== test: gh77-standup-triage ==
  PASS: corruption from a FAIL: line classifies tier 1
  PASS:   and the opening line counts it as critical
  PASS:   and it is not silently dropped as a degraded lens
  PASS: 8 tier-1 items: exactly 7 rendered
  PASS:   and the 8th is counted, not silenced
  PASS:   and the notices line names the escape hatch
  PASS:   and page 2 renders the 8th
  PASS:   and the render is exactly 12 lines, inside the 15-line cap
  PASS: a tier-1 item re-renders on the second run (never suppressed)
  PASS:   and is not counted as suppressed
  PASS: an unchanged tier-5 item is suppressed on rerun
  PASS:   and does not re-render
  PASS:   but a changed live state re-raises it (fingerprint, not display string)
  PASS:   and the escalation to tier 4 is visible
  PASS: an unmeasured item never jumps a known-age peer
  PASS: two lenses reporting one entity collapse to one item
  PASS: overflow parks into the frozen PARKED/ schema
  PASS:   and the record carries a fingerprint
  PASS:   and carries a read-only check probe
  PASS:   and a rerun over unchanged state writes nothing (byte no-op)
  PASS: a fully degraded run exits 3 (degraded, not clean)
  PASS:   and still fits the 15-line cap
  PASS:   and names every degradation id (lossless collapse)
  PASS:   and names D6 too
  PASS:   and reports an empty list honestly
  PASS: an unknown verdict code is refused
  PASS: an over-long verdict clause is refused (no wall of text via the clause)
  PASS: an embedded delimiter is escaped, so the line keeps exactly 2 top-level separators
  PASS:   and the payload text survives the escape (lossless)

  PASS: lens 2 artifact classifies to tier 1
  PASS: lens 2 degrades loudly with D5
  PASS: lens 3 behind classifies to tier 5
  PASS: lens 3 degrades loudly with D5
  PASS: lens 7 diverged classifies to tier 5
  PASS: lens 4 finds open PR 51
  PASS: lens 4 pin classification for CLEAN
  PASS: lens 4 pin classification for non-CLEAN (BLOCKED goes to 6)
  PASS: lens 4 structured candidate emits merge_state
  PASS: lens 4 degrades loudly with D1
  PASS: lens 4 truncates at 50 and degrades with D2
  PASS: lens 4 D2 case still emits its 50 candidates
  PASS: lens 4 D2 case expected first candidate remains present
  PASS: lens 5 finds triage issue
  PASS: lens 5 structured candidate emits live_state with updatedAt
  PASS: lens 5 degrades loudly with D1
  PASS: lens 5 manifest source contributes exactly its issue number
  PASS: unchanged lens 5 item is suppressed on rerun
  PASS:   and does not re-render
  PASS:   but a changed live state (updatedAt) re-raises it
  PASS: lens 1 finds session mention
  PASS: lens 1 degrades loudly with D6
  PASS: lens 6 finds overdue release
  PASS: lens 6 degrades loudly with D5
  PASS: lens 8 finds done work
  PASS: lens 8 degrades loudly with D3
  PASS: lens 7 degrades loudly with D4
  PASS: all-degraded cleanly triggers all degradation modes (D1, D3, D4, D5, D6)
  PASS: all-degraded reports D3
  PASS: all-degraded reports D4
  PASS: all-degraded reports D5
  PASS: all-degraded reports D6
  PASS: all-degraded fits within 15-line display cap

  PASS: lens degrades loudly when fixture is missing
  PASS: lens 3 degrades loudly on non-integer rev-list
  PASS: lens 3 degrades loudly on failed dirty-tree check
  PASS: JSON encoding handles branch name with double quotes
  PASS: lens 1 degrades loudly on malformed session schema
  PASS: lens 1 degrades loudly on empty session
  PASS: lens 8 degrades loudly on malformed check object
  PASS: general PARKED checklist leaves lens 8 healthy
  PASS: general PARKED note is not a standup candidate
  PASS: general PARKED note does not enter standup fingerprint suppression

  PASS: collector exits non-zero when jq is unavailable (got 3)
  PASS: it still emits VALID JSON with jq unavailable — never an empty stdin
  PASS: fallback document contains exactly lenses 1-8 all as D5
  PASS: every lens degrades loudly with D5 when jq is unavailable

  PASS: an unparseable roadmap-sync summary degrades to D4
  PASS:   and fabricates no candidate from it
  PASS: a real diverged summary yields the canonical counts payload
  PASS: an ordinary degraded lens exits 3, as SKILL.md publishes
  PASS:   and a fully clean collection still exits 0
  PASS: a fixture that supplies no mtime degrades D5 rather than emitting a null-staleness item
  PASS:   and a supplied mtime is carried as the candidate's staleness
  PASS: an adversarial path is single-quoted in the close command
  PASS:   the path survives shell word-splitting as one literal token (substitution is inert)
  PASS: no upstream (exit 128) falls back to the trunk and says so
  PASS:   its staleness is unknown, never a fabricated date
  PASS:   and its close is an inspect action, never a bare git push
  PASS: a tracked divergence carries a committer date as staleness
  PASS:   and an unreadable date degrades rather than emitting a dateless item
  PASS: lens 7 carries the ROADMAP.md mtime as staleness
  PASS: lens 7's close syncs the roadmap ledger

  PASS: a count-shaped fragment inside a non-summary line degrades to D4
  PASS:   and yields no candidate from the decoy counts
  PASS: a staged rename yields the destination path
  PASS: an UNSTAGED rename (" R") is handled by the same path as a staged one
  PASS: a rename whose SOURCE contains " -> " is still parsed correctly
  PASS:   and a rename entry with no source field degrades rather than misreading the next entry
  PASS: a UTF-8 pathname needs no decoding and arrives intact
  PASS:   as does a pathname containing a double quote
  PASS: an entry with a status and no pathname degrades
  PASS: a whitespace-only entry degrades rather than being skipped as blank
  PASS: an unrecognised status field degrades
  PASS:   and none of them is reported as a successful collection
  PASS: a newline pathname is emitted with an escaped one-line display
  PASS:   as an inspect action, not a command built from an unrenderable name
  PASS:   and it is never dropped — the operator still learns the file is there
  PASS:   so the rendered screen keeps one physical line per item
  PASS: a non-integer mtime degrades instead of producing invalid JSON at exit 0
  PASS: an untracked PARKED/ path is excluded without degrading the lens
  PASS: a date stream with a malformed line degrades rather than filtering it away
  PASS: a date stream shorter than the divergence count degrades
  PASS: an unterminated final entry is a truncated read, not a finding
  PASS: a rename with an empty source field degrades
  PASS: a status pair git cannot emit degrades
  PASS:   but the ignored pair (!!) is legal and still yields a candidate
  PASS:   and the unmerged pair (UU) is legal too
  PASS: a staged type-change (T) is valid porcelain, not a degradation
  PASS:   as is an unstaged one
  PASS: a pathname ending in LF keeps its trailing byte through the shell handoff
  PASS:   and its stat resolves on the exact bytes, not the stripped name
  PASS: a non-UTF-8 pathname is escaped unambiguously, not normalised away
  PASS:   and gets an inspect close, never a runnable command built from it
  PASS:   while the lens stays ok — the item is escaped, not dropped or degraded
  PASS:   and its stat resolves on the exact bytes
  PASS: every fixture yields a parseable document — no input silences the collector

  PASS: lens 1 degrades loudly (D6) if actionable item has missing/malformed quote/what/close
